sect1.sect2:
    Preparing for the NVIDIA-r580 Installation

    &nvidia-common-kernel;



      Extract the NVIDIA-r580 driver runfile and
      navigate to the extracted directory:


sh NVIDIA-Linux-x86_64-&nvidia-r580-version;.run -x &&
cd NVIDIA-Linux-x86_64-&nvidia-r580-version;

